cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this guide, please cite it as below."
title: "Lending Model Monitoring Guide"
abstract: "A practical monitoring framework for lending models at small institutions (CDFIs, community development credit unions, community banks, and loan funds): what to check, how often, alert thresholds sized for small portfolios, owners and actions, input-level fair-lending review, and documentation templates, with a spreadsheet calculator and a worked example on synthetic data."
authors:
